{1}{Ah...a true player.  Not one we've seen in many years, and none so promising.  Are ye ready for the next question, laddie?}{Ah...a true player.  Not one we've seen in many years, and none so promising.  Are ye ready for the next question, lass?}{}{}{}{}
{2}{Yes.  Please continue.}{}{5}{}{5}{}
{3}{E:}{}{5}{}{0}{}
{4}{}{}{}{}{}{}
{5}{That's the spirit!  Though before I begin, I feel I must tell you...this game is an old and mysterious one.  Let it be known that the stakes are always high, as are the rewards...}{That's the spirit!  Though before I begin, I feel I must tell you...this game is an old and mysterious one.  Let it be known that the stakes are always high, as are the rewards...}{}{}{}{}
{6}{Understood.  And the question?}{}{5}{}{14}{}
{7}{What exactly are the stakes?}{}{5}{}{10}{}
{8}{Hmmm.  Maybe I'll wait until I know more about this...}{}{5}{}{0}{}
{9}{}{}{}{}{}{}
{10}{No!  I've said too much already.  There are things not meant to be said, and the price for saying them is one I'm not about to pay...this world is home to things other than just you and I...}{No!  I've said too much already.  There are things not meant to be said, and the price for saying them is one I'm not about to pay...this world is home to things other than just you and I...}{}{}{}{}
{11}{Whatever you say, halfling.  Let's get started.}{}{5}{}{14}{}
{12}{That's it.  I'm leaving this strange game.}{}{5}{}{0}{}
{13}{}{}{}{}{}{}
{14}{A brave one you are.  Well done.  You might just win this yet.  The question is...Death to one, while birthing another---trees begin to shiver around its grandmother.  What am I?}{A brave one you are.  Well done.  You might just win this yet.  The question is...Death to one, while birthing another---trees begin to shiver around its half-brother.  What am I?}{}{}{}{}
{15}{The wind.}{}{5}{}{}{qu 1009 6, fl 20}
{16}{The sun.}{}{5}{}{}{qu 1009 6, fl 20}
{17}{The spring.}{}{5}{}{22}{qu 1009 3}
{18}{Twilight.}{}{5}{}{}{qu 1009 6, fl 20}
{19}{I'll think on this and return later.}{}{5}{}{0}{}
{20}{Sorry, but no.  And perhaps it's just as well...more times than not, those who play this game know not into what they've fallen...(sigh).  Fare the well.}{Sorry, but no.  And perhaps it's just as well...more times than not, those who play this game know not into what they've fallen...(sigh).  Fare the well.}{}{}{}{}
{21}{}{}{}{}{}{}
{22}{Well, well, well.  Seems like a ruby moon since any soul's played this well.  Just north of here you will find the stony ground.  There you will find the last of us.  Think on this my friend...you can still stop playing...}{Well, well, well.  Seems like a ruby moon since any soul's played this well.  Just north of here you will find the stony ground.  There you will find the last of us.  Think on this my friend...you can still stop playing...}{}{}{}{}
{23}{Thank you for the advice.  I'll be on my way.}{}{5}{}{0}{}
{24}{}{}{}{}{}{}
{25}{How do ye do?  I may be a'talkin' to ye later.  Seek one like me just to the east of Black Root.  Until then, I can say nothing...}{How do ye do?  I may be a'talkin' to ye later.  Seek one like me just to the east of Black Root.  Until then, I can say nothing...}{}{}{}{}
{26}{Nothing left to do here, friend.  Walk through the Withered Grove, to the stony ground.  Be wary, and be wise.}{Nothing left to do here, friend.  Walk through the Withered Grove, to the stony ground.  Be wary, and be wise.}{}{}{}{}
{27}{You'll be one of the legends, my boy.}{You'll be one of the legends, lass.}{}{}{}{}
{28}{Sorry, but the game can only be played once, and you've already lost.}{Sorry, but the game can only be played once, and you've already lost.}{}{}{}{}
{29}{There be the blood of my brethren on yer hands!  Die!}{There be the blood of my brethren on yer hands!  Die!}{}{}{}{}
